[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitlabel3dlayout"]

; The one variable: how a Label3D lays its text out. Row 1 breaks a long text at `width` with
; WORD_SMART. Row 2 stretches two lines to `width` with FILL. Row 3 stands a two-line block above
; its origin (BOTTOM) beside one hung below it (TOP). Row 4 moves an upper-case label by `offset`.
; No other golden sets `width`, `autowrap_mode`, `vertical_alignment`, `offset` or `uppercase`.

